OL,3,AProtesters clash with police in Paris
OL,4,Aand across France during major day of
OL,5,Ademonstrations
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds have been arrested across
OL,8,FFrance during a day of major protests
OL,9,Fover falling education standards and
OL,10,Fthe cost of living
OL,12,FIn Paris, protesters are clashing with
OL,13,Friot police - you can watch live above
OL,15,FA tourism office has been set on fire
OL,16,Fin Lyon, while protesters have broken
OL,17,Finto and damaged town hall buildings in
OL,18,FLille and Marseille - the interior
OL,19,Fministry condemns what it calls
OL,20,F"targeted acts of violence"
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
